---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Dispatch from '../../../components/Dispatch';
import attribution from '../../../../public/app/dispatch/data/ATTRIBUTION.txt?raw';
---

<Base
  title="Dispatch | Proof of Concept Bakery"
  description="One day's delivery stops on a map of Salt Lake City, the server's proposed plan, the plan VROOM makes in your browser, the two compared, and the one that is published."
  screen="dispatch"
>
  <h1>Dispatch</h1>
  <p>
    Staff plan each day's deliveries here: the confirmed stops, one to four vans leaving the bakery
    and coming back. The server proposes a plan, your browser can plan the same stops with a
    different method, and the Dispatch object checks whichever you send and decides what is
    published. The places are public parks, libraries and stations that stand in for made-up
    addresses.
  </p>
  <Dispatch client:load />
  <section>
    <h2>Map and route data</h2>
    <p class="fine">{attribution.trim()}</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a>; routing by
      openrouteservice (self-hosted).
    </p>
  </section>
  <p>
    <a href="/app/">Back to the console</a>
  </p>
</Base>
